  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "あいてを　おこらせる。　３ターンの\nあいだ　あいては　ダメージを\nあたえる　わざしか　だせなく　なる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "상대를 화나게 한다.\n3턴 동안 상대는 데미지를\n주는 기술밖에 쓸 수 없게 된다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "激怒對手。\n在３回合內讓對手\n只能使出給予傷害的招式。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Provoque l’ennemi. L’oblige à n’utiliser que des attaques\npendant trois tours.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Bringt das Ziel in Rage. Dieses kann über drei Runden\nhinweg nur noch angreifen.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Enfurece al objetivo para que solo use movimientos de\nataque durante tres turnos.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Provoca il bersaglio inducendolo a usare solo mosse\nd’attacco per tre turni.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The target is taunted into a rage that allows it to use\nonly attack moves for three turns.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "相手を　怒らせる。　３ターンの\n間　相手は　ダメージを\n与える　技しか　だせなくなる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
